{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"To factor means to rewrite an expression as a product. Let's try dividing the expression $64b-16c$ by each factor.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $16$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}64b-16c\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=16\\left(\\dfrac{64b-16c}{16}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=16\\left(\\dfrac{64b}{16}-\\dfrac{16c}{16}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=16(4b-c)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $64b-16c$ is equivalent to $16(4b-c)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $4$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}64b-16c\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=4\\left(\\dfrac{64b-16c}{4}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=4\\left(\\dfrac{64b}{4}-\\dfrac{16c}{4}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=4(16b-4c)\n\\end{align}$\n\nNo, $64b-16c$ is *not* equivalent to $4(16b-4)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $8$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}64b-16c\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=8\\left(\\dfrac{64b-16c}{8}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=8\\left(\\dfrac{64b}{8}-\\dfrac{16c}{8}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=8(8b-2c)\n\\end{align}$\n\nNo, $64b-16c$ is *not* equivalent to $8(8b+2c)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $2$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}64b-16c\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2\\left(\\dfrac{64b-16c}{2}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2\\left(\\dfrac{64b}{2}-\\dfrac{16c}{2}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2(32b-8c)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $64b-16c$ is equivalent to $2(32b-8c)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"The following expressions are equivalent to $64b-16c$:\n\n- $16(4b-c)$\n- $2(32b-8c)$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Factor $64b-16c$ to identify the equivalent expressions.**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $64b-16c$.","content":"$16(4b-c)$","correct":true},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $64b-16$.","content":"$4(16b-4)$","correct":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $64b+16c$.","content":"$8(8b+2c)$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $64b-16c$.","content":"$2(32b-8c)$","correct":true,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":true,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":true,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
